  (text "Trax HA - ZL 400 VF Board (XIAO) - Home Assistant controller for Dimplex ZL 300/400 VF (terminal board PCB3)"
    (at 25.4 17.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left))
    (uuid "bba04f7a-a5f5-4aee-b95e-8588c792bebf")
  )
  (text "24 V SIDE (from the ventilation unit). Fully isolated from the ESP32 side: no shared ground. D7 and D8 protect against reversed 24 V."
    (at 25.4 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid "eeb66bc7-56b6-4d4d-a9ca-bc2f2cf2cae8")
  )
  (text "INPUTS: the unit pulls an AUS line to GND when active -> optocoupler LED lights (2.3 mA)\n-> GPIO goes HIGH (10k pull-down). Diode protects the optocoupler against reversed wiring."
    (at 76.2 36.83 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid "f459d485-111b-4d54-acbb-d42b191da994")
  )
  (text "OUTPUTS: GPIO HIGH -> optocoupler -> PNP transistor puts +24 V on the EIN line (like pressing the panel button). R18/R19 hold the outputs off while the ESP32 boots or is unpowered. R20/R21 limit the current if an EIN line is shorted."
    (at 76.2 198.12 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid "39830400-c869-4b44-bdf4-2b2c4abb35a9")
  )
  (text "Seeed XIAO ESP32-C6 (ESP32-C5 fits with other GPIO numbers), USB-C power only.\nLeft header: D0 D1 D2 D3 D4 D5 D6   Right header: 5V GND 3V3 D10 D9 D8 D7\nD2, D3, D8, D9 are left unused: they are boot strapping pins on some XIAO variants."
    (at 246.38 88.9 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid "2356ab30-cf33-4ad2-a806-5cd434693586")
  )
  (text "AUS_0 fault -> D0   AUS_1 level 1 -> D1   AUS_2 level 2 -> D4   AUS_3 level 3 -> D5   AUS_4 auto -> D6\nEIN_0 up <- D10   EIN_1 down <- D7"
    (at 25.4 271.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left))
    (uuid "64b1ba45-7030-4418-bb9e-faee392bd1c4")
  )
